gate: CLOSED
v:4 c:$ m:navitrack-config role:dev x:frontend
task: S19 T11 — Confirm before a write to the sensor
sprint: S19
dep: S19-T9-sensor-profile-template.pd
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV, BUN]
test_mandate: ../intel/TEST-COVERAGE-MANDATE.md
quality_mandate: ../intel/CODE-QUALITY-MANDATE.md
invariants: ../S19-INVARIANTS.md

context: |
  Write settings, write calibration, graduation overwrite, and password
  change send immediately. Field use can brick a tank table or a password.
  Ask in the existing sheet/modal before each of those four. Cancel sends
  no frame. Confirm sends the same command as today. Read and live refresh
  stay immediate. No new protocol. Web + FakeBle. Package manager: bun.

out:
  - confirm step on the four write actions
  - co-located tests

cmd:
  - bun run test

done:
  - Cancel on each write leaves the adapter with no new frame
  - Confirm still performs that write
  - `bun run test` passes
